ine Beast Stewards. Even though these same cute animals led to her infection, she still feeds and cares for them. So it's no surprise Haze gets along with other Felines like Mousse."}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Haze%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Haze%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Elite 2","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Haze%20-%20Elite%202.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Haze%20-%20Elite%202.webp"},{"label":"The Nursing Home Creepshow","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Haze%20-%20The%20Nursing%20Home%20Creepshow.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Haze%20-%20The%20Nursing%20Home%20Creepshow.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{"The Nursing Home Creepshow":"18 OP"},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Caster","type":"class","entries":[{"operatorName":"Eyjafjalla","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Eyjafjalla%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"All [Caster] Operators' ATK +16% (+2%) when Eyjafjalla is deployed","matchedKeyword":"Caster"}]},{"operatorName":"Mostima","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Mostima%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"When deployed, increases the SP recovery rate of all Casters by +0.4/second (only the highest effect of this type takes place)","matchedKeyword":"Caster"}]},{"operatorName":"Rosmontis","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Rosmontis%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"When deployed, grants +8% ATK to this unit and a random deployed Caster Operator","matchedKeyword":"Caster"}]},{"operatorName":"Lava the Purgatory","operatorIconPath":"/five-star-icons/Lava%20the%20Purgatory%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"Immediately obtains 35 (+5) SP after first deployment. On eac